proofs.description:
Project an edge to the classes of its endpoints. Conversely, an edge of
the quotient has representatives related to the given source vertex;
its bisimulation matches that edge from the given source.

Insert the right summand into the sum of the two atomic arguments.
The induced morphism of plugged contexts reverses evaluation order;
the assumed meet equality then identifies the sum's value with a.

Choose an extremal context, then give each successor component its own
rooted incoming piece. The split comparisons give the lower bound;
merging the copies preserves acceptance from the original witness.

Compact unused outputs of each legacy yield, retaining its variable
map. Conversely instantiate the supported yield test on renamed systems;
initial and planted root yields remain separate.
